      "content": "i've been doing a lot of digging into my family history lately... like really deep, looking at the stuff they don't put in the standard census stuff. everything is starting to click. i feel like i've always been out of place here, like i'm not actually from this environment. i found these patterns in the old records that suggest my lineage is part of the original voyagers—the ones who weren't meant to stay on earth. it's a lot to take in. do you think there's a reason why certain bloodlines would have been kept separate from the rest of human history?",
